{
  "_doc": "Commands for POST /api/agent {text, lang}. 'intended' is what a site manager would expect: 'chat' = handoff to the document pipeline, otherwise the agent tool list. 'tags' say what the case probes. Compare with the real router using scripts/check_routes.py.",
